[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=NaMiOS Welcome
Name[vi]=Chào mừng NaMiOS
Comment=Thiết lập lần đầu cho NaMiOS
Comment[vi]=Thiết lập lần đầu cho NaMiOS
Exec=namios-welcome
Icon=namios-welcome
Terminal=false
Categories=System;Settings;
X-GNOME-Autostart-enabled=true
OnlyShowIn=KDE;

# Ghi chu (khong anh huong Desktop Entry): file nay chi dieu khien "chay luc
# dang nhap" (UI-005). Logic "chi hien 1 lan roi khong tu mo lai" (vd kiem tra
# file danh dau ~/.config/namios/welcome-done) la viec cua chinh ma Python
# namios_welcome (xem distro/live-build/config/hooks/normal/0300-namios-
# welcome.hook.chroot + docs/specs/UX-WINDOWS-FAMILIAR.md muc 7) - autostart
# .desktop khong tu co kha nang "chi chay 1 lan".
#
# Cap nhat 10/11/2026: tu wave nay, nguoi dung bam "Hoan tat" trong wizard
# KHONG CHI ghi ~/.config/namios/welcome.json nua ma con AP THAT len desktop
# session hien tai (bo go fcitx5 Telex/VNI, co chu Plasma, MIME app mac
# dinh docx/xlsx/pdf, may in mac dinh CUPS) - xem ham
# namios_welcome.firstrun.apply_runtime_desktop_settings + file
# usr/share/namios/docs/FIRST-RUN.md. Moi co che ap deu tu co lap loi rieng
# (khong he nao lam sap phien dang nhap lan dau) va bi bo qua yen lang neu
# may thieu cong cu he thong tuong ung (kwriteconfig6/xdg-mime/lpoptions) -
# KHONG doi Exec= o tren, toan bo logic nay nam trong chinh `namios-welcome`.
#
# verified_on_host: NO - Icon=namios-welcome la TEN icon placeholder (icon
# that CHUA co, xem usr/share/namios-branding/README-PLACEHOLDER.md); neu
# khong ton tai trong theme, Plasma roi ve icon fallback chung, khong crash.
# Phan "ap THAT" o tren cung verified_on_host: NO - xem FIRST-RUN.md.
